        "text": "Page: Blessid Union of Souls. Sentence: Blessid Union of Souls (sometimes abbreviated to Blessid Union or BUOS) is an American alternative rock band from Cincinnati, Ohio that was formed in 1990 by friends Jeff Pence and Eliot Sloan.\nPage: Blue Peter (band). Sentence: Blue Peter is a Canadian new wave synthpop band founded in 1978 in Markham, Ontario by Chris Wardman and Paul Humphrey.\nPage: Blue Peter (band). Sentence: In their heyday, Blue Peter opened for major international acts such as the Police and Simple Minds.\nPage: Hey Leonardo (She Likes Me for Me). Sentence: \"Hey Leonardo (She Likes Me for Me)\" is a song by American alternative rock group Blessid Union of Souls from their third album, \"Walking Off the Buzz.\"\nPage: Test Patterns for Living. Sentence: Test Patterns for Living was the first release, an EP, by the Toronto-based new wave band Blue Peter.",
